  "url": "https://new.web.cafe/tutorial/detail/h6hjs0sl2a",
  "title": "【2024.1.31案例拆解】later.com",
  "author": "哥飞",
  "authorAvatar": "https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_avatar.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "哥飞案例拆解"
  ],
  "content": "<div>later.com 月访问量266万 buffer.com 月访问量297万 两个都是社交媒体账号和内容管理分析平台，看他们做了些哪些关键词，会发现有意思的点。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_img1.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>用内容找到自己产品的潜在用户。</div>\n<div>或者说，去分析自己的潜在用户可能会搜索哪些关键词，就去做内容获取相关流量，以吸引潜在用户进站。</div>\n<div>这个结论是什么呢？ 意思是我们做了某些工具，不一定就仅仅盯着工具对应的关键词，而应该扩展更多关键词，只要是潜在用户可能会搜索的关键词，都可以去做。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_img2.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_img3.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>就是你那份代码吧</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_img4.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>有意思，“seo tools” 这个词，buffer 的页面比专业研究 SEO 的 moz 和 ahrefs 都更靠前。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_img5.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_img6.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_img7.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>三个都是91分的高权重域名， moz 明明还更多外链，居然都只能排第二。</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_img8.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_img9.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_img10.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_img11.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_img12.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_img13.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>只能去猜测了，这个最近更新了，标题也更符合搜索关键词。\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_img8.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div>这个就没有那么符合\n<img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_img9.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/h6hjs0sl2a_img14.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>",
